'' -fsanitize=address is refused for the MinGW-ABI 'win64' target, which has no ASan runtime to
'' link (windows-x86_64 has one): TKO0179.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -fsanitize=address -target win64 -c tests/driver/src/asan.tiko -o tests/driver/src/asan-mingw.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0179: -fsanitize=address is not supported for target 'win64'
